                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of my favourite VN's. I highly recommend it. The tactical battles can be tough, but as long as you make use of your save slots you should be able to make it through with a bit of trial-and-error. A negative is that you can't skip battles on newgame+ so you'll have to fight all of the battles again if you want to play all of the routes. You'll have much higher stats and more knowledge so they are a lot quicker and there isn't exactly a True Ending in this VN so it's not all bad. Remember that Ctrl lets you speed-up attack animations!",
